{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssueDocuments","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The library provides the functionality to issue documents using OpenID4VCI."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/GetStarted","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/ManageDocuments","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/SecureAreas","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/PresentationService","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/TrustMark","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/WalletUI"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To issue a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using this functionality, EudiWallet must be property initialized.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"userAuthenticationRequired","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is true, user authentication is required. The authentication prompt message has localisation key “issue_document”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"After issuing a document, the document data and corresponding private key are stored in the wallet storage.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Credential-proof-policy","text":"Credential proof policy"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" uses the HAIP-compliant credential proof policy and accepts only attested proofs. To interoperate with an issuer that requires a plain JWT proof without key attestation, set "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration\/allowPlainJwtProof","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" for that issuer:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = OpenId4VciConfiguration(","  credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/issuer.example.com\",","  clientId: \"my-wallet\",","  allowPlainJwtProof: true",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enabling this flag accepts all supported proof types using ES256, ES384, or ES512. Leave it disabled unless plain JWT proof support is required.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Issue-document-by-docType-or-credential-configuration-identifier","text":"Issue document by docType or credential configuration identifier"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the document docType to be issued use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"issueDocuments(issuerName:docTypeIdentifiers:credentialOptions:keyOptions:promptMessage:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Currently, only mso_mdoc and sd_jwt formats are supported"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method returns an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssuerResponse"},{"type":"text","text":" containing the issued documents together with the issuer registration policy and any warnings produced when registration certificate validation is enabled (see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows how to issue an EUDI Personal ID document using OpenID4VCI:"}]},{"code":["do {","  let credentialOptions = CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .oneTimeUse, batchSize: 5)","  let keyOptions = KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")","  let response = try await userWallet.issueDocuments(","    issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","    docTypeIdentifiers: [.msoMdoc(docType: EuPidModel.euPidDocType)],","    credentialOptions: credentialOptions,","    keyOptions: keyOptions","  )","  \/\/ documents (response.documents) have been added to wallet storage, you can display them","}","catch {","  \/\/ display error","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also issue a document by passing a configuration identifier. The configuration identifiers can be retrieved from the issuer’s metadata using the "},{"code":"getIssuerMetadata(issuerName:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"code":["\/\/ Get issuer metadata for a specific issuer","let metadata = try await wallet.getIssuerMetadata(issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\")","\/\/ Use configuration identifier","let credentialOptions = CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .oneTimeUse, batchSize: 5)","let keyOptions = KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")","let response = try await userWallet.issueDocuments(","  issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","  docTypeIdentifiers: [.identifier(\"eu.europa.ec.eudi.pid_vc_sd_jwt\")],","  credentialOptions: credentialOptions,","  keyOptions: keyOptions",")","let doc = response.documents.first"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For SD-JWT credentials, use ","type":"text"},{"code":".sdJwt(vct:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let response = try await userWallet.issueDocuments(","  issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","  docTypeIdentifiers: [.sdJwt(vct: \"eu.europa.ec.eudi.pid_vc_sd_jwt\")],","  credentialOptions: CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .rotateUse, batchSize: 1),","  keyOptions: KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")",")","let doc = response.documents.first"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Issue-multiple-documents","text":"Issue multiple documents","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can issue multiple documents in a single operation using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"issueDocuments(issuerName:docTypeIdentifiers:credentialOptions:keyOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["do {","  let credentialOptions = CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .rotateUse, batchSize: 1)","  let keyOptions = KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")","  let response = try await wallet.issueDocuments(","    issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","    docTypeIdentifiers: [","       .identifier(\"eu.europa.ec.eudi.pid_mdoc\"),","       .identifier(\"eu.europa.ec.eudi.pid_vc_sd_jwt\")","    ],","    credentialOptions: credentialOptions,","    keyOptions: keyOptions","  )","  \/\/ All returned documents (response.documents) have been added to wallet storage.","  for failure in response.failures {","    print(\"Not issued: \\(failure.configurationIdentifier): \\(failure.error.localizedDescription)\")","  }","}","catch {","  \/\/ display error","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method efficiently issues multiple documents from the same issuer by creating a single credential offer with all requested document types.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If one credential configuration fails, the other issuance tasks continue. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"response.documents"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the documents already saved in the wallet, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"response.failures"},{"type":"text","text":" identifies each failed configuration with its document type (or VCT) and original error. Run post-issuance registration for the returned documents and retry only the failed configurations to avoid duplicates."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup and authorization failures still throw. If every issuance task fails, the original error for the first requested configuration is thrown. Callers using "},{"code":"OpenId4VciService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" directly can use "},{"code":"issueDocumentsWithResults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to receive the same per-configuration results; the existing "},{"code":"issueDocuments","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method continues to return the successfully stored documents."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"text":"Get Default Credential Options","anchor":"Get-Default-Credential-Options","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can retrieve issuer-recommended credential options before issuing:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let defaultOptions = try await wallet.getDefaultCredentialOptions(","  issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","  docTypeIdentifier: .msoMdoc(docType: EuPidModel.euPidDocType)",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Credential-Reuse-Policy-Precedence-ETSI-TS-119-472-3--ARF-Annex-II","text":"Credential Reuse Policy Precedence (ETSI TS 119 472-3 \/ ARF Annex II)","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When an issuer publishes a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"credentialReusePolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" in its metadata, the wallet enforces that policy regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CredentialOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" passed by the caller. Specifically:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The wallet currently supports these issuer reuse policies:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".limitedTime"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onceOnly"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rotatingBatch"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"credentialPolicy","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".oneTimeUse"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".rotateUse","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"batchSize","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reissueTriggerUnused"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"reissueTriggerLifetimeLeft","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are always derived from the issuer’s published policy and override any values in the caller-supplied "},{"code":"CredentialOptions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When no issuer reuse policy exists (the issuer metadata contains no ","type":"text"},{"code":"credentialReusePolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the caller’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"CredentialOptions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are used as-is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["### Resolving Issuer Registration","","Use ``EudiWallet\/resolveIssuerRegistration(issuerName:credentialConfigurationIds:)`` to check whether an issuer is registered for a given set of credential types **before** starting an issuance flow. This avoids issuing a document only to discover afterwards that the issuer's registration certificate does not cover the requested credential type.","","The method returns an ``IssuerResponse`` with an empty `documents` array, containing the decoded ``WrpRegistrationPolicy`` and any ``RegistrationPolicyViolation`` entries. See <doc:RegistrationCertificate> for details on interpreting the result.","","```swift","let result = try await wallet.resolveIssuerRegistration(","    issuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","    credentialConfigurationIds: [\"eu.europa.ec.eudi.pid_mdoc\"]",")","if let policy = result.wrpIssuerPolicy {","    \/\/ Show issuer info: policy.name, policy.country","}","if let warnings = result.wrpIssuerWarnings, !warnings.isEmpty {","    \/\/ The issuer registration has issues — inspect violations before proceeding","}"]},{"anchor":"Resolving-Credential-offer","text":"Resolving Credential offer","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The library provides the "},{"code":"resolveOfferUrlDocTypes(offerUri:authFlowRedirectionURI:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method that resolves the credential offer URI."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The method returns the resolved "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OfferedIssuanceModel"},{"type":"text","text":" object that contains the offer’s data (offered document types, issuer name, grants, and transaction code specification for pre-authorized flow). When registration certificate validation is enabled ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration\/validateRegistrationCertificate"},{"type":"text","text":"), the model also includes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OfferedIssuanceModel\/wrpVciRegistrationPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" — the parsed issuer registration policy decoded from the WRPRC."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OfferedIssuanceModel\/wrpVciWarnings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — validation warnings keyed by credential configuration identifier; the empty key holds request-wide warnings. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when validation is not enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer’s data can be displayed to the user, including issuer registration information and any warnings, before proceeding to issuance. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for details."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a pre-registered issuer can be resolved from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offerUri"},{"type":"text","text":", the method uses that issuer’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration\/issuerMetadataPolicy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example shows how to resolve a credential offer:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[" func resolveOfferUrlDocTypes(offerUri: String, authFlowRedirectionURI: URL?) async throws -> OfferedIssuanceModel {","    return try await wallet.resolveOfferUrlDocTypes(","      offerUri: offerUri,","      authFlowRedirectionURI: authFlowRedirectionURI","    )","  }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After user acceptance of the offer, the selected documents can be issued using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issueDocumentsByOfferUrl(offerUri:docTypes:txCodeValue:promptMessage:configuration:)"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"txCodeValue"},{"text":" parameter is not used in the case of the authorization code flow.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The method returns an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssuerResponse"},{"text":" containing the issued documents together with the issuer registration policy and any warnings produced when registration certificate validation is enabled (see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example shows how to issue documents by offer URL:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["","let config = OpenId4VciConfiguration(","  credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/issuer.example.com\",","  clientId: \"my-wallet\",","  issuerMetadataPolicy: issuerMetadataPolicy",")","","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try EudiWallet(","  eudiWalletConfig: EudiWalletConfiguration(),","  trustConfig: trustConfig,","  openID4VciConfigurations: [\"trusted_issuer\": config]",")","","\/\/ Resolve the offer to get document models with recommended credential options","let offer = try await wallet.resolveOfferUrlDocTypes(offerUri: offerUrl, authFlowRedirectionURI: nil)","","\/\/ Use the offered documents as-is with recommended settings, or customize them","let customizedDocTypes = offer.docModels.map { docModel in","  \/\/ You can customize credential options (batch size, credential policy)","  docModel.copy(","    credentialOptions: CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .oneTimeUse, batchSize: 2),","    keyOptions: KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")","  )","}","","\/\/ Issue with customized settings","let newDocs = try await wallet.issueDocumentsByOfferUrl(","  offerUri: offerUrl,","  docTypes: customizedDocTypes,","  txCodeValue: txCode",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Authorization code flow","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Authorization-code-flow"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the authorization code flow to work, the redirect URI must be specified via the ","type":"text"},{"code":"authFlowRedirectionURI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The user is redirected in an authorization web view to the issuer’s authorization endpoint. After the user authenticates and authorizes the request, the issuer redirects the user back to the application with an authorization code. The library exchanges the authorization code for an access token and issues the document.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration\/authResponseIssChecking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to control validation of the authorization response "},{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter (RFC 9207). The default, "},{"code":".never","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", skips validation. With "},{"code":".ifSupported","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is required when the authorization server advertises support, and any received "},{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must match the server’s issuer. With "},{"code":".required","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", issuance also fails if the server does not advertise support."}]},{"code":["let config = OpenId4VciConfiguration(","    credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/issuer.example\",","    clientId: \"wallet-client\",","    authResponseIssChecking: .required",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Client-driven web authorization","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Client-driven-web-authorization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default the library presents the authorization flow in an "},{"code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". An application can take over this step by providing its own "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/AuthorizationFlowHandler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OpenId4VciConfiguration\/authorizationFlowHandler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" property. The handler receives the authorization URL and the configured redirect URI, presents the authorization flow however it wants (external browser, "},{"code":"SFSafariViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or in any other custom way) and returns the full redirect URL once the authorization server redirects back. The redirect URL may alternatively contain a presentation request in case of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssueDocuments#Dynamic-issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Pre-Authorization-code-flow","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Pre-Authorization code flow"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When Issuer supports the pre-authorization code flow, the resolved offer will also contain the corresponding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information. The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OfferedIssuanceModel\/grants"},{"type":"text","text":" field exposes whether the offer includes "},{"code":"authorization_code","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"pre-authorized_code","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or both. When a transaction code is required, the "},{"code":"txCodeSpec","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field in the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/OfferedIssuanceModel"},{"type":"text","text":" object will contain:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The input mode, whether it is NUMERIC or TEXT","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The expected length of the input"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The description of the input","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From the user’s perspective, the application must provide a way to input the transaction code."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After user acceptance of the offer, the selected documents can be issued using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"issueDocumentsByOfferUrl(offerUri:docTypes:txCodeValue:promptMessage:configuration:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When the transaction code is provided, the issuance process can be resumed by calling the above-mentioned method and passing the transaction code in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"txCodeValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Dynamic-issuance","level":3,"text":"Dynamic issuance","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wallet kit supports the Dynamic "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/eu-digital-identity-wallet\/eudi-wallet-product-roadmap\/issues\/82","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"issueDocuments(issuerName:docTypeIdentifiers:credentialOptions:keyOptions:promptMessage:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"issueDocumentsByOfferUrl(offerUri:docTypes:txCodeValue:promptMessage:configuration:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the wallet application need to check if the doc is pending and has an ","type":"text"},{"code":"authorizePresentationUrl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property. If the property is present, the application should perform the OpenID4VP presentation using the presentation URL. On success, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"resumePendingIssuance(issuerName:pendingDoc:webUrl:credentialOptions:keyOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method should be called with the authorization URL provided by the server.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if let urlString = newDocs.documents.last?.authorizePresentationUrl { ","\t\/\/ perform openid4vp presentation using the urlString ","\t\/\/ on success call resumePendingIssuance using the authorization url","\tlet resumedDoc = try await wallet.resumePendingIssuance(","\t\tissuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","\t\tpendingDoc: pendingDocument,","\t\twebUrl: authorizationURL,","\t\tcredentialOptions: CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .rotateUse, batchSize: 1),","\t\tkeyOptions: KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")","\t)","}"]},{"anchor":"Deferred-Issuance","level":4,"text":"Deferred Issuance","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For deferred document issuance, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestDeferredIssuance(issuerName:deferredDoc:credentialOptions:keyOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let issuedDoc = try await wallet.requestDeferredIssuance(","\tissuerName: \"eudi_pid_issuer\",","\tdeferredDoc: deferredDocument,","\tcredentialOptions: CredentialOptions(credentialPolicy: .rotateUse, batchSize: 1),","\tkeyOptions: KeyOptions(secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\")",")"]},{"anchor":"Document-Reissuance","level":3,"text":"Document Reissuance","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"reissueDocument(documentId:credentialOptions:keyOptions:promptMessage:backgroundOnly:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method to reissue an existing document using previously stored issuance metadata and authorization data. The method returns an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssuerResponse","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" containing the reissued document along with the WRPRC policy and any registration violations."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieves the document’s metadata from storage and resolves the appropriate OpenID4VCI service via the credential issuer identifier."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If persisted authorization data is available, it is forwarded to the service to avoid re-authentication.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Falls back to the original issuance metadata for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"credentialOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" when not explicitly provided."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"code":"backgroundOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", reissuance only proceeds if stored authorization data is available. If no stored authorization exists, an error is thrown. This is useful for automatic credential refresh without user interaction."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Interactive reissuance (default) - may prompt the user for authentication","let reissued = try await wallet.reissueDocument(","    documentId: existingDocument.id,","    credentialOptions: credentialOptions,  \/\/ optional, defaults to original","    keyOptions: keyOptions,                \/\/ optiona